OL,3,GNEWSAThe rare chance to examine
OL,4,Acenturies-old Coptic manuscripts
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 400 Coptic Christians have
OL,7,Fhad the rare opportunity to examine
OL,8,Fmanuscripts which were centuries old -
OL,9,Fthanks to a library in Manchester.
OL,11,FPeople travelled from across the UK to
OL,12,Fread the manuscripts, which were
OL,13,Fwritten in Coptic - an ancient Egyptian
OL,14,Flanguage - with some dating back to the
OL,15,F10th century.
OL,17,FThe historical Coptic and Ethiopian
OL,18,Fmanuscripts are normally housed in The
OL,19,FUniversity of Manchester's John Rylands
OL,20,FLibrary.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
