OL,3,GNEWSAThe rare chance to examine
OL,4,Acenturies-old Coptic manuscripts
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Jeremy Penner, senior curator at the
OL,7,Flibrary, said there was "something
OL,8,Fquite remarkable" about a manuscript
OL,9,F"finding itself once again among people
OL,10,Fwho know its prayers, recognise its
OL,11,Fsaints and continue its traditions".
